id: pm-4of199
title: "An extension command that declares no flags hands every undeclared option to its handler, although the dynamic validator documents refusing them"
description: "Found while fixing pm-gh1666 on 2026.11.7. An extension registers demo-plain with registerCommand and no registerFlags. pm demo-plain --bogus --json exits 0 and the handler receives options.bogus = true; pm demo-plain --all --json delivers options.all = true. validateDynamicExtensionCommandOptions in src/cli/runtime/invocation-options.ts is documented to reject all supplied options when a command declares no flags, and cli-main-errors.spec asserts that refusal on the function directly, but the built CLI never reaches it with these options. A command with declared flags refuses the same spellings as unknown options, so the two shapes disagree. The unknown-option refusal on a command with flags also lists --no-extensions and the read-output controls as expected flags, although a non-read extension command refuses them. Duplicate check: searched undeclared option, no flags, dynamic validator and unknown option across all statuses; pm-in23qu and pm-8nyc own unknown-option suggestions, not this leak."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags[4]: agent-ux,extensions,flags,validation
created_at: "2026-11-07T08:59:15.085Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-07T17:18:51.777Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: "pm <cmd> --bogus on an extension command that declares no flags exits 2 with an unknown-option refusal naming the command, and the handler never runs; Root-only flags (--all, --explain) are refused the same way unless the command declares them; The unknown-option refusal on an extension command lists only the flags that command accepts: its declared flags plus its inherited host flags from pm contracts, not --no-extensions or read-output controls on a non-read command; An integration spec drives the built CLI for both command shapes, with a negative control that bypasses the validator"
parent: pm-ugqx
risk: low
confidence: high
severity: medium
repro_steps: "Register demo-plain with registerCommand and no flags, then run pm demo-plain --bogus --json"
expected_result: exit 2 unknown-option refusal; the handler does not run
actual_result: exit 0 and the handler receives options.bogus = true
affected_version: 2026.11.7
component: extensions
dependencies[4]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
  pm-gh1666,discovered_from,"2026-11-07T08:59:15.085Z","harness:claude-code","cli:create:dep",detected
